and Oscar® winning composer and lyricist Stephen Schwartz, the soundtrack includes two new original songs featured in the film: “No Place Like Home” performed by 3x Academy Award® nominee, Grammy-winning Cynthia Erivo as Elphaba, and “The Girl In The Bubble” performed by Academy Award® nominee, Grammy-winning Ariana Grande as Glinda.  \n\nIn addition, “The Wicked Witch of the East” is exclusively featured on the film soundtrack. It has never previously been released as part of the Original Broadway Cast Recording.  \n\nThe soundtrack also features fan-favorites “Thank Goodness,” “As Long As You’re Mine,” “No Good Deed,” and the title track “For Good.”  \n\nWicked: For Good arrives in theaters November 21, 2025.","author":"Various","audioPreviewUrl":"https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/audio-previews/56e1f21d71e540363d9d833e879ca1766dee9f2786f7dd7160c65e37787ee088/mqeiLxLjW14PV5zU47nSq2SqjZ0e7H3tqvMGAArXLJw.mp3","abridged":false,"accent":"US English, UK English","copyright":"© ℗ 2025 Universal Studios and Republic Records, a division of UMG Recordings, Inc. and Verve Label Group, a division of UMG Recordings, Inc.","maxAge":12,"minAge":0,"media":{"duration":2694,"fileSize":43609459,"hasStreams":false},"cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/7gt8tH9EUZfdGro24Q7hKLTm482gdgW7mXsNhOk9SVY"},"status":{"name":"complete","updatedAt":"2025-11-19T13:44:58.885Z"},"languages":["en"],"accents":["US English","UK English"],"authors":["Various"],"copyrights":["© ℗ 2025 Universal Studios and Republic Records, a division of UMG Recordings, Inc. and Verve Label Group, a division of UMG Recordings, Inc."],"musicTypes":["fantasy"]},"slug":"wicked-for-good","title":"Wicked: For Good - The Soundtrack","userId":"yoto","sortkey":"wicked-for-good","clubAvailability":[],"cardId":"gwCNR","createdAt":"2025-07-22T08:26:30.240Z","updatedAt":"2025-11-19T16:14:48.473Z","scanToAdd":false},"ownership":{"canAccess":true,"userHasRole":false,"cardIsFree":false,"cardIsMadeB